gguf-rco step 6h, third part (0038): every int8 type tile-major.
The loader repacks every shard of a type with a tile-major decode kernel
(IQ3_S, IQ4_XS, Q4_K, IQ3_XXS, IQ2_XXS, IQ2_XS, IQ2_S) and frees the raw
rows; every call of such a tensor goes through the tiles op with the type as
its argument - the type's tile kernel up to 32 rows, the dequantised tiles
(IQ3_S by its tile dequantiser, the others un-repacked for the CUDA one) and
cuBLAS above. Applies after 0037.

